@startuml
title Forge: ignite

participant Anyone #EEEEEE
participant Server #EEEEEE
participant Forge #E6E0FA
participant "CREDIT token" as CREDIT #E6E0FA

note over Server: signs the attestation
Server -> Anyone: attestation
Anyone -> Forge: ignite(payer, amount, power, attestation)
note over Forge: verify signature, expiry, id
note over Forge: compute cost and duration
Forge -> CREDIT: burn(payer, cost)
note over Forge: store the entry
Forge --> Anyone: entry
@enduml
